# Dev only. Vite loads this automatically for `npm run dev` and never for `vite build`.
#
# In development the client is served by Vite on :5173 and the Worker (`npm run worker`) runs
# separately on :8787 — two different origins, so the same-origin default in useOnlineGame.ts is wrong here
# and has to be overridden. In production one Cloudflare Worker serves both and this file is absent
# from the build, which is the whole point: prod has nothing to configure.
VITE_SERVER_URL=ws://localhost:8787
